# Nothing else is excluded on purpose.
#
# In particular, all of build/ is committed - the QA tools, the recorded edit
# patches, the per-batch validation certificates, the 414 preview volumes, the
# sample volumes, the contact sheets, and build/qa/stories-baseline.pdf, which is
# the deliberately defective pre-fix file (8,452 boxes) kept as the negative
# control for build/notdef_scan.py. These document how the curriculum was made and
# let it be used as a learning resource without rebuilding anything.
